  "daily_overview": "今日全球局势动荡与技术革新并进。地缘政治方面，美国政府在关键期前与俄罗斯达成柴油供应协议，引发乌克兰及国际争议；同时，针对国际刑事法院（ICC）的制裁措施亦遭到盟友批评。金融市场方面，能源价格压力迫使企业削减预期，而SpaceX入局频谱业务导致美国电信巨头市值显著缩水，引发资本市场对行业格局重构的担忧。科技领域持续高歌猛进，联想天禧代码智能体 TianxiCode 刷新 SWE-bench-Live 全球记录，各类自主智能体正加速从实验室走向真实物理世界，旨在提升复杂任务的应对能力。总体来看，AI 领域的边际效应正在从模型堆叠转向深度应用，而传统能源与全球供应链的博弈依然是影响资本与物价的核心变量。\n\nGlobal affairs and tech innovation move in tandem today. Geopolitically, the U.S. has struck a diesel supply deal with Russia ahead of midterm elections, sparking controversy, while new sanctions on the ICC face criticism from allies. In finance, rising energy costs dampen corporate outlooks, and SpaceX's move into spectrum has triggered a sharp sell-off in U.S. telco stocks. Tech advances remain rapid, with Lenovo's TianxiCode hitting a new global record on SWE-bench-Live, marking a shift toward embodied, real-world AI applications. Overall, AI is moving from raw scale to deep application, while energy and supply chain games continue to dominate market volatility.",
